<title>USA: FMR group holds 10.17 pct Cadiz Land stake.</title>
<headline>FMR group holds 10.17 pct Cadiz Land stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by FMR Corp, the parent of the investment adviser to Fidelity Funds, said Thursday it held a 10.17 percent stake in Cadiz Land Co Inc or 1,991,467 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include the sale of 38,500 common shares sold between July 29 and September 24 at prices ranging from $4.250 to $5 per share.</p>
</text>
